# ==============================================================================
# NETEXPERT AI (212) — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Path ke file biner executable SWI-Prolog (swipl / swipl.exe).
#
# PANDUAN PENGISIAN:
# - Windows Default : C:\Program Files\swipl\bin\swipl.exe
# - Windows Drive D : D:\swipl\bin\swipl.exe
# - macOS (Homebrew): /opt/homebrew/bin/swipl (Apple Silicon) atau /usr/local/bin/swipl (Intel)
# - Linux (APT)     : /usr/bin/swipl
#
# JIKA DIKOSONGKAN:
# Sistem akan otomatis mencari di PATH bawaan sistem operasi komputer kamu.
# ==============================================================================
SWIPL_PATH=
